@startuml
' ============================================================================
' HOROCONSULTANT — SDLC ライフサイクル ライフサイクル (PlantUML)
' ขอบเขต: Hooks + CI + Release Gate + Production
' แหล่งอ้างอิง:
'   - .github/workflows/{ai_cicd.yml, ci.yml, jira-governance.yml, post-deploy-tdd.yml, dod-production-gate.yml}
'   - .githooks/{pre-commit, pre-push}
'   - scripts/tdd_gate.py, scripts/test_provenance_guard.py, scripts/post_commit_check.py
' ============================================================================
skinparam backgroundColor #1B2430
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #2E4A6B
skinparam ActorFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam BoxBackgroundColor #3A4A62

title HoroConsultant SDLC ライフサイクル (Hooks + CI + Release Gate + Production)

rectangle "SDLC ライフサイクル วงจร totality" as SDLC {
  ' --- LOCAL (Developer Mac) ---
  box "🖥️ LOCAL (Developer Mac)" AIS {
    participant "BA\n(business_analyst /\nba_intake)" as BA
    participant "QA\n(qa_tester)" as QA
    participant "PRE-COMMIT" as PRE_COMMIT
    participant "PRE-PUSH" as PRE_PUSH
    participant "Developer\n(developer)" as DEV
  }

  ' --- GITHUB ACTIONS CI ---
  box "📡 GITHUB ACTIONS CI" AIS {
    participant "CI.\yml\n(Unified CI)" as CI
    participant "AI_CICD.yml\n(AI Safety Audit)" as AICI
    participant "JIRA-GOV\n(jira-governance)" as JIRA_GOV
  }

  ' --- POST-DEPLOY TDD ---
  box "🧪 POST-DEPLOY TDD" AIS {
    participant "TEAM RED\n(attack simulation)" as TEAM_RED
    participant "TEAM BLUE\n(validation)" as TEAM_BLUE
  }

  ' --- RELEASE GATE ---
  box "🚪 RELEASE GATE (dod-production-gate.yml)" AIS {
    participant "ORCH\n(orchestrator)" as ORCH
    participant "HITL" as HITL
    participant "DEVOPS" as DEVOPS
  }

  ' --- PRODUCTION ---
  box "🏭 PRODUCTION" AIS {
    participant "HF Docker\npphothidaen/horoconsultant-core-backend\n(sdk: docker)" as HF_SPACE
    participant "Vercel\nhttps://horo-consultant-psi.vercel.app" as VERCEL
  }

  ' --- AGENT LAYERS (logic) ---
  participant "TDD GATE\n(tdd_gate.py)\nTOD RED->GREEN->Review->Done" as TDD_GATE
  participant "PROVENANCE GUARD\n(test_provenance_guard.py)" as PROV_GUARD
  participant "DOC SYNC\n(run_doc_sync.sh)" as DOC_SYNC
  participant "CODE REVIEW\n(code_reviewer.py)" as CODE_REV
  participant "SECRET SCAN" as SEC_SCAN
  participant "POST-COMMIT CHECK\n(post_commit_check.py)" as POST_CHECK
}

' ============================================================================
' SEQUENCES
' ============================================================================

' --- Phase 0: BA intake ---
BA -> QA : 9-Dim grill \nspecs -> ATOMIC_TICKET.md / plans/plan.md
BA -> QA : ticket READY (agent-* label)

' --- Phase 1: QA writes test (TDD RED) ---
QA -> TDD_GATE : Red test first\n(tests/ + manifest)
TDD_GATE -> TDD_GATE : Backlog -> TDD RED\n(failing test)

' --- Phase 2: QA verifies (TDD GREEN) ---
QA -> TDD_GATE : all tests pass\n+ provenance manifest
TDD_GATE -> TDD_GATE : TDD RED -> TDD GREEN
TDD_GATE -> PROV_GUARD : test provenance verified\nTEST_BASELINE_VERIFIED

' --- Phase 3: Pre-commit local gate ---
QA -> PRE_COMMIT : commit\n(test_provenance_guard.py\n+ jira_label_gate.py)
PRE_COMMIT -> PRE_COMMIT : read-only\nconsole only\n(exit 0/1, non-blocking)

' --- Phase 4: Developer coding ---
DEV -> TDD_GATE : source code\n(+ Test-Baseline trailer)
TDD_GATE -> TDD_GATE : TDD GREEN -> Review

' --- Phase 5: Pre-push local gate ---
DEV -> PRE_PUSH : push\n(tdd_gate.py\n+ test_provenance_guard.py)
PRE_PUSH -> PRE_PUSH : per-commit coverage\ndocs-only exemption (KAN-180)

' --- Phase 6: GitHub Actions CI ---
DEV -> JIRA_GOV : PR open (KAN-NN prefix)\nJira sync
JIRA_GOV -> JIRA_GOV : PR title regex\nexit on failure\nsync Issue: Review
DEV -> CI : push / PR (main)
DEV -> AICI : push / PR
AICI -> AICI : code_reviewer.py --review --use-python\nsecurity audit, AST, secret scan
CI -> CI : test_provenance_guard.py verify-pr\nconfig drift detection\ndoc sync (run_doc_sync.sh)

' --- Phase 7: Post-deploy TDD (after prod deploy) ---
TEAM_RED -> TEAM_RED : attack simulation\npython .github/scripts/redteam_attack.py
TEAM_BLUE -> TEAM_BLUE : validation\npython .github/scripts/blueteam_validate.py
TEAM_RED -> TEAM_BLUE : parallel\n+ Jira auto-create on failure

' --- Phase 8: Release gate ---
TEAM_BLUE -> DEVOPS : evidence bundle\nrelease notes, tag, push, clean worktree
DEVOPS -> ORCH : automated review\nDoD verification
ORCH -> ORCH : 100% tests green\nsecrets 0\ntag + push + worktree clean
ORCH -> HITL : HITL approval\n(release, data safety, model promotion)
HITL --> DEVOPS : approve / reject

' --- Phase 9: Production ---
DEVOPS -> HF_SPACE : HF Docker deploy\n(sdk: docker)\nrollback revision record
DEVOPS -> VERCEL : Vercel deploy\ngateway/API
HF_SPACE -> VERCEL : full path: Vercel -> Render -> HF Space
DEVOPS -> ORCH : 100% DONE\nticket complete\narchive plans (22-rule)

' ============================================================================
' NOTES
' ============================================================================
note right of PRE_COMMIT
  Local hooks — read-only verify only
  exit 0 = pass, non-zero = warn (console)
  ไม่บล็อก commits
end note

note right of PRE_PUSH
  Local hooks — read-only verify only
  TDD state gate + provenance
  docs-only exemption (KAN-180)
end note

note bottom of CI
  GitHub Actions CI — ระบบตรวจสอบจริง
  - code_reviewer.py --review (security, AST, static scan)
  - test_provenance_guard.py verify-pr
  - run_doc_sync.sh (KAN-308 4D)
  - config drift detection (M11)
end note

note bottom of RELEASE GATE
  Release gate ก่อน production
  100% green + secrets 0 + docs sync clean
  + HITL approval (human authority)
  2 surfaces: HF Docker + Vercel
end note

' Reference locations
footer
  .githooks/ : pre-commit, pre-push, commit-msg, prepare-commit-msg\n
  .github/workflows/ : ai_cicd.yml, ci.yml, jira-governance.yml,\n
    post-deploy-tdd.yml, dod-production-gate.yml, update-index.yml\n
  scripts/ : tdd_gate.py, test_provenance_guard.py,\n
    post_commit_check.py, run_doc_sync.sh, verify_doc_index.py
end footer
@enduml
